o Forte",["Updated"]],["p-c00fa82f8e87d5fa.html","source-block-455","tmux impossibilities. too bad",["Updated"]],["p-c00fa82f8e87d5fa.html","source-block-488","tmux/Q/Is it possible to split a pane for copy-mode scrollback above and live shell below like vim?",["Updated","tmux impossibilities. too bad"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-12","I've been really enjoying ear's new album Rumspringa. It's got synth, ambient recordings, funky melodies, binaural peeks into virtual realities (e.g. amelie-ish ernest hood moments). It's like the mirror image of diegetic music. I hear their music and it tells me a story of their actual reality, rather than being told a fictional story where I hear the music the characters are hearing.",[]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-667","obsidian",[]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-679","Obsidian/Q/In obsidian, how can I reveal the currently focused page in the side bar?",["obsidian"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-772","Obsidian/Q/Can I quickly copy an Obsidian wikilink to a heading on the current page?",["obsidian"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-865","Obsidian/Plugin/Easy Copy",["obsidian"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-899","Obsidian/Plugin/Copy Link",["obsidian"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-933","Obsidian/Q/Does obsidian allow a list of links to other obsidian pages in the YAML markdown frontmatter?",["obsidian"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-1046","entities",[]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-1058","Logseq/Entity/Software/Plugin",["entities"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-1096","openspec",[]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-1108","OpenSpec/Dir/Inability to customize openspec dir location",["openspec"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-1174","Updated",[]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-1188","Obsidian/Q/In obsidian, can I do transclusions so element from one document appears in another document? If so, how?",["Updated"]],["p-2332b05dbc0254b0.html","source-block-1312","Logseq/Entity",["Updated"]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-12","Agent/Skills/Support in Multiple Tools",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-58","Claude/Code/Q/How do I disable the Update available notification in Claude Code?",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-146","nvim/Plugin/render-markdown.nvim",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-186","awk/Q/How can I extract the first column?",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-235","ghq/Q/How can I search GitHub for a repo and clone it with ghq in one line?",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-318","ghq/Q/Using ghq, what's the easiest way to cd to the local repo if it exists?",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-403","skillshare",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-421","Person/Willie",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-442","Person/Willie/GitHub/my-skills",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-480","Updated",[]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-494","Vercel/GitHub/Skills",["Updated"]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-522","rulesync",["Updated"]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-538","skillshare",["Updated"]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-556","GitHub/MCP/How To/Set up in Cursor with 1Password GH token",["Updated"]],["p-a025431d6de8dbc3.html","source-block-622","nvim/Q/Is there a quick way to use glow to preview the current markdown file while editing in nvim?",["Updated"]],["p-98ac78af858ea8c5.html","source-block-0","Added vercel-labs/skills to my global toolchain. I'm just evaluating it at this point, but I suspect it can be used for declarative skills that are shared across multiple agentic coding tools. In that sense it's a bit duplicative of rulesync. I prefer how vercel has the ability to have symlinked .agents/skills to .claude/skills. I also like how it follows the \"one thing well\" philosophy. I could keep using rulesync 